      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-32-2024-june/q1",
      "question": "<figure class=\"practice-figure\" style=\"max-width:90mm;margin:2mm auto\"><img src=\"resources/exams/edexcel-9ma0-32-2024-june/q01-figure.svg\" alt=\"Figure 1. A particle P of mass 0.5 kg shown as a dot resting on a horizontal line representing the plane.\"></figure><p>Figure 1 shows a particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> of mass <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0.5\\,\\mathrm{kg}\"></span> at rest on a rough horizontal plane.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find the magnitude of the normal reaction of the plane on <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li></ol><p>The coefficient of friction between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> and the plane is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{2}{7}\"></span></p><p>A horizontal force of magnitude <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"X\"></span> newtons is applied to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span>.</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is now in limiting equilibrium,</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"X\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
