      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-32-2024-june/q4",
      "question": "<p><strong>In this question you must show all stages of your working.</strong></p><p><strong>Solutions relying entirely on calculator technology are not acceptable.</strong></p><p>[<em>In this question,</em> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\"></span> <em>is a unit vector due east and</em> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf j\"></span> <em>is a unit vector due north. Position vectors are given relative to a fixed origin</em> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span>.]</p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\\geqslant1\"></span>, the position vector of a particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\"></span> metres, where</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=ct^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\mathbf i-\\frac{3}{8}t^2\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\"></span> is a constant.</p><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=4\"></span>, the bearing of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> from <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"135^\\circ\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=3\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Find the speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=4\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=T\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is accelerating in the direction of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-\\mathbf i-27\\mathbf j)\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"3\"><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol>",
